{"parse": {"title": "山麓的回音-04", "pageid": 135155, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3-03\" title=\"山麓的回音-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">山麓的回音-04</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3-05\" title=\"山麓的回音-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">山麓的回音</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">04</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"\"></span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> </div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"luyingdi_ye\"><img alt=\"luyingdi_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/600px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/900px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-luyingdi_ye.png/1200px-Cg-luyingdi_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>汇报一下进度，塞梅尔维斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>一切顺利，琳赛女士。我们已经确定了“佩希塔”撤离的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>琳赛女士未做回答，这是示意塞梅尔维斯做进一步给出解释的信号。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>他们将被囚者带到了附近的一座废弃村落里，似乎是想要将对方隐藏起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>作为一个与大量谋杀案有所关联的激进组织，他们的行为显得与过往的作风并不相符。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>显然，他们试图在这位绑架者身上获得某些极为重要的东西，让他们足以放弃一贯以来作风的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>那么，你的判断是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我对此有个不太成熟的推测。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>请说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我推测，这个被囚禁起来的人与神秘学家难民群体有关。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>原因是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>根据我们以及其他委外合约小队在维也纳的调查结果，我们基本上可以判断出重塑之手当前阶段的目的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>重塑之手正在试图煽动数量庞大的神秘学家难民群体，给人类当权者制造混乱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>无论他们打算谋划暴动或是谋杀，这些走投无路的、绝望的神秘学家难民群体都是重塑之手最好的生力军。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>然而，由于基金会与奥匈帝国的阻挠，重塑之手的煽动仍旧处在一个相对较小的规模。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>重塑之手不会满足于此，他们必然要寻找到某些能够更快渗透难民群体的方式——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>与难民的首领合作，或是……杀掉他们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>也就是说，你认为被绑架者是难民群体中的某位领导者？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>数量如此之多的神秘学家难民能够从巴尔干半岛前往维也纳，意味着他们存在着组织结构。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>考虑到“佩希塔”更加倾向于软禁……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>那么，最为合理的分析是，囚禁者在难民群体中，有着一个即便是重塑之手也无法简单取代的特殊地位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>这些难民也并非是铁板一块，其中必定有倾向于重塑的派系和期望与重塑保持距离的派系。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>这或许就是两个派系之间斗争的缩影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>你的推断有一定道理的猜测，也与基金会先前获得的信息一致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>既然如此，尽快完成任务，并查清楚他们的目的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>在完成这次的外出回到基金会后，康复中心会提出一套新的治疗方案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>关于你的病症，他们搜集到了一些信息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>感谢你，琳赛女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>与我无关，是康复中心的同僚们为此做出了贡献。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>此外，我还有一则信息要与你同步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>拉普拉斯科算中心刚刚已经得出了结论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>时代的临界点已经生成——就在维也纳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>作为“前”调查员，我想你应当清楚这代表着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在确切的听到这个消息时，塞梅尔维斯的身体紧绷了一瞬间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等她重新取回身体的控制权时，她的神情已经变得严肃了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我需要与霍夫曼同步这个情报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>这是应有之义。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>一直以来，重塑之手对于临界点的研究都走在了我们的前面。因此，重塑之手也一定获得了这一情报。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>抱歉，琳赛女士。我担心追随者们会在此情况之下做出什么极端行为，我必须加快脚步了。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "山麓的回音-04"}}